---
name: homelab-vars
description: >
  Resolves the placeholders used in infra/k3s-pi/ docs (<PI_HOST>,
  <PI_SSH_USER>) to their real values for this machine's homelab. Copy this
  file to homelab-vars.local.md (gitignored) and fill in real values -
  never commit the filled-in version.
---

# Homelab variables

Placeholders used in `infra/k3s-pi/README.md` and related files, and what
they resolve to on this machine:

| Placeholder | Value |
|---|---|
| `<PI_HOST>` | (e.g. `your-pi-hostname.example.com`) |
| `<PI_SSH_USER>` | (e.g. `your-ssh-user`) |

When following a recipe in `infra/k3s-pi/`, substitute these in before
running any command.
